@prefix cafe-rsn: <https://ontara.dev/data/cafe/reasoning/> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix ontara-rsn: <https://ontara.dev/ontology/reasoning/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .


# =============================================================================
# Ontology declaration
# =============================================================================

<https://ontara.dev/data/cafe/reasoning/> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Cafe Reasoning Instances"@en ;
    dcterms:created "2026-11-01" ;
    owl:imports <https://ontara.dev/ontology/bmm/axioms> ,
                <https://ontara.dev/ontology/tenant-types/> ,
                ontara-rsn: ;
    rdfs:comment """OWL named individuals for the Cafe (coffee shop demonstrator),
patterned on the Ears module (ears-reasoning-instances.ttl). H-0055.

Created Session 518 (Plan B Stage 0, S0.4), when it restated the status-axis
declarations of the Cafe's two canonical runtime types by hand. Since S0.5
Pass B8 (Session 525, H-0647) those declarations are generated by the OWL
pipeline (scripts/gen_owl_pipeline.py, Stage 3g) into
generated/ontology/ontara-tenant-types.ttl, under the same IRIs, with the
runtime axis vocabulary (one predicate per axis, one AxisValue individual
per value). Source of truth: the SysML model,
exercises/coffeeshop-demonstrator/model/domain/coffeeshop.sysml.

This file holds only what the model cannot give: the Cafe's cross-axis
rule (no line moves from queued to in preparation while its order's
payment is unpaid), the AxisPrecondition individual
cafe-rsn:orderline-orderPaid, has its standing as a reasoning
HardConstraint, a boundary a move cannot cross (S146-D8; S151's Cafe
instantiation of HardConstraint is food hygiene and allergen rules, and
this is the same kind of boundary on a move; both classes are information
content entities, so the double typing is satisfiable), and its label.
Everything else about it is generated.

IRI namespace: https://ontara.dev/data/cafe/reasoning/ (data namespace,
per the IRI scheme). All individuals use the cafe-rsn: prefix."""@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "Session 518 — S0.4 initial population: three axes, twelve moves, one cross-axis precondition"@en ,
                    "Session 525 — S0.5 Pass B8 (H-0647): the axis declarations are generated into ontara-tenant-types.ttl; this file keeps the precondition's HardConstraint typing and its label"@en .


# =============================================================================
# The cross-axis rule's standing as a HardConstraint (not in the model)
# =============================================================================

cafe-rsn:orderline-orderPaid a ontara-rsn:HardConstraint ;
    rdfs:label "Order paid before line preparation"@en .
